WEBVTT

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.450
Anyway, try not to provoke him.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.630
Whatever he says, let's just play along.

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:47.920
I would if I could understand him, 
but he makes no sense.

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.280
It just takes wisdom and courage.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.240
The doctor said it's probably 
just a temporary memory lapse.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.340
Maybe we should keep him out 
of school for a bit longer.

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.690
Wisdom and courage! Understand?

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:04.220
Onii-chan... Just when I thought you'd 
bounced back from the bullying.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.730
Yo!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:08.730
Y-Yo.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:12.400
Man, I really get out of shape 
when I don't go out hunting.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:13.530
Hunting?!

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:17.120
Yes, of course. Hunting is 
a great source of vitality.

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.360
Oh, yeah!

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:20.910
Why don't we all go hunting 
together sometime?

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:22.710
That sounds great! Let's go!

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:24.280
This is pathetic.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:31.040
Zokusho

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.610
<i>I can't believe Tsutsuga submitted.</i>

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.070
<i>The sword that will rule over this world...</i>

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.920
<i>So that Hayagami is really...</i>

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:39.380
We will arrive in Kagutsuchi shortly.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.350
<i>I'm home,</i>

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:45.600
<i>Emisu.</i>

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:55.790
I thought I was gonna die!

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.060
We managed to hold out 
until we reached land.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:02:59.570
Yeah...

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.370
<i>Hey! The mast is gonna break!</i>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:08.000
<i>It's falling apart in several places!</i>

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.870
<i>Bro! The boat's gonna sink!</i>

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:13.520
<i>Don't give up! You wanna 
see your mom, right?!</i>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.790
<i>As long as you're still 
breathing, keep pedaling!</i>

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:34.520
<i>Hayagami, Sho, leading the nation...</i>

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:37.200
<i>What am I even doing?</i>

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.010
This feels nice...

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:53.330
Okay, Gatoya is here, so we...

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:55.920
are here. In Narutaki.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.250
Narutaki?

00:03:57.810 --> 00:03:58.800
Where's the capital?

00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:01.300
The capital is here.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.080
It's that far away?

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:11.230
<i>I want you to bring your Hayagami 
to me before my life runs out.</i>

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:13.640
I wonder if we'll make it.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:17.760
Hmm, if we set out for the 
capital from Narutaki...

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.240
We'll have to go through 
Lord Kannagi's domain.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.570
Domain? He controls a country?

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:29.480
Amawakuni is divided into twelve 
domains, excluding the capital.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:33.910
Each domain is ruled 
by one of the Twelve Shinsho.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.680
You mean, they're kings?

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:37.630
Hey, Bro!

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:40.840
Is that bonfire smoke?

00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.440
That's odd. There shouldn't 
be any villages around here.

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:45.800
Could it be...

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.590
Kannagi?

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.890
They're just ordinary people.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:56.230
What are they doing?

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.020
They don't look like nomads.

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.440
Hey!

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.530
Are you...

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:07.160
Ginchi?!

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.330
It really is you, Kuruni-san!

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.730
Bro! It's okay!

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:15.250
These guys are from my village!

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:15.250
Ginchi?

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:18.510
Ginchi...

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.540
You're Ginchi, aren't you?

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.170
Mom...

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.660
Mom!

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:29.260
Ginchi, I'm so glad you're safe!

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:35.300
I kept this ring the whole time!

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.030
So we'd meet again...

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.520
Thanks to this ring, 
I really got to see you again!

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:42.370
But where were you all this time?

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:43.470
I was...

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.180
Bro!

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.950
I'm happy for you, Ginchi.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.270
Yeah!

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.850
This is Bro. He saved me.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.200
Then thank you for helping my son.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.300
Oh, it was no big deal.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.290
To the border lands?

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:07.720
Yes. Now that the princess has fallen, 
chaos will seize the nation.

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:13.250
We decided to migrate to the border 
lands before war breaks out.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.800
Got it tied tight?

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:16.770
Yeah.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.620
War?

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:23.760
Kuruni, I'm sorry, but would 
you help with the packing?

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:24.810
Sure.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.190
Pardon me.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.130
But, chaos?

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:33.930
Won't the Twelve Shinsho rule 
in the princess's place?

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.200
What are you talking about?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.170
Which of the Twelve Shinsho 
will rise to the top, then?

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:43.590
Only one person can reign 
over the whole nation.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.490
A princess, or a king.

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.630
A king?

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:49.330
The highest of all the Sho.

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.080
In the past, the Twelve Shinsho

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:55.350
fought amongst themselves 
for the throne,

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.470
but the princess assumed the throne 
and took control over the Kamui,

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.420
and the nation was at peace.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.830
But...

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:07.440
Now that the princess has fallen, 
it'll revert to an age of war?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.960
What, you even forgot about that?

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.660
We're leaving!

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:14.910
Hurry up, Bro!

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.450
I guess this is where we say goodbye.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.960
It's almost time.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:33.100
The path to the border lands 
opens once a month.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.890
Let's go, everyone.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.330
Travel with care.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.840
I pray you'll reach the capital safely.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.720
Thank you.

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.710
Hurry up, Ginchi.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:51.490
Okay!

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.030
Take care, Kotoha-neechan!

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:57.910
Arata-san, your Kamui was amazing!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.230
No, it's you guys who were amazing.

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:04.500
Keep on being yourselves, okay?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.530
Don't be untrue to yourselves.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.790
Okay! Let's go, Bro.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.010
Take care, you two!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.320
Bro, what's wrong?

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.570
The waterfall!

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.500
Ginchi!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.410
Hurry up, Bro!

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:36.410
Don't!

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.370
The path is closing up!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.820
Bro!

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.980
Be happy with your mom, okay?

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.790
Never leave her again!

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:50.250
Later, Ginchi!

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:52.910
Bro...

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.230
Why did you...

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.260
I can't go.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.780
It was my friends in the thieves' gang 
who attacked Ginchi's village

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.820
and took him from his mom.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:17.940
But...

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:21.320
Go. You guys should leave, too.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.690
Are you sure?

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:28.410
I'm sure.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.590
I don't want to be untrue to myself.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.010
Master Arata...

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.100
What?

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.590
Okay, listen to me!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:48.150
Otherwise, I'll leave you here!

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.930
What? What are you—

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:51.810
Let's go!

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:54.780
Hey! Let go of me, you jerk! Hey!

00:09:55.230 --> 00:09:57.300
Until we get to the capital, 
health comes first,

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.810
violence is forbidden, 
and we stay safe!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:00.810
Got that?

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:01.370
Huh?!

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:03.660
Yes!

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.160
Are you all right?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.220
What's the deal?

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:24.040
For all your big talk, 
you don't have much stamina.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.750
Let's rest for a bit.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.480
Yeah, sorry.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.420
Here.

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.400
It'll give you energy.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:34.770
Thanks.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:41.120
You said this is "muru"? 
What kind of animal is that?

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.490
What kind? A muru is a muru.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:48.120
Oh, yeah. I guess it's pointless to 
ask you to compare it to something.

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:52.700
<i>Sure is peaceful.</i>

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:55.150
<i>I can't imagine war breaking out.</i>

00:10:58.450 --> 00:10:59.390
What's that?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.070
Wh-What is that weird creature?!

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:08.700
Oh, perfect timing. That's a muru.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.060
How can you be so calm?!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:14.130
It's all right. 
They're not aggressive creatures.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:19.270
Uh, it's angry.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.320
Yes, it is.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.990
R-Run!

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:27.950
I want some muru.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.000
Muru?

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.390
That's right! Muru is great, isn't it?

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:34.420
Yeah! Let's have muru tonight!

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:37.760
What the heck is muru?

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:51.870
Dumb animal.

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:58.650
I've never seen a muru get so mad.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.190
Huh? Who are you?

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.640
None of that!

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.800
That's a muru egg.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.240
Put it back right now!

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:07.250
No! I'm giving it to the mistress!

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.990
What if that thing comes back?!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:15.710
It's all on you, Kanate!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:16.880
Huh? Huh?!

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.180
What?!

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.010
Think he'll be okay?

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.770
He'll be fine, I'm sure.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.340
I'm not so sure.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.800
Still, to steal its egg...

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:43.900
Why did you do such a thing?

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:47.400
Because muru eggs are very nutritious.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.930
The mistress is expecting a baby.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.500
A baby?!

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.850
I want her to eat this and have the 
strongest baby in the village.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.590
Oh, how cute!

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:06.720
After I finally managed 
to get an egg! Why?!

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:09.170
Don't laugh!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.680
What's going on, Honi?

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:14.920
Master!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:15.870
Kanate!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.900
You're okay!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.940
This man saved me.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.140
But that was mean, Arata!

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:24.620
Oh, sorry...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:30.060
Arata!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.240
Master Arata!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.580
So Hinohara was absent again today.

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.730
They said he's not feeling well,

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:39.750
but I bet he's faking it 
and locking himself in his room again.

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.710
<i>Don't you run from me,</i>

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.100
<i>Hinohara.</i>

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.700
Oh, you're awake?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:57.800
Where are we?

00:13:57.800 --> 00:13:59.450
Ohika-san's house.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.170
Ohika-san?

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:01.110
Oh!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.030
I see you're awake.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.900
I'll call my husband.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.450
Okay, Fuyo-san!

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:10.240
I must let Kotoha-san know, as well.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:16.400
You should be grateful to Kotoha-chan.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.210
You had a really bad fever.

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:21.290
Kotoha-chan was healing 
you the whole time

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.640
with that Uneme power of hers.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:26.240
Hey! My cell phone!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.180
Give me that!

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:29.760
What's with you? 
I was just looking at it!

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:34.930
Good. It's not broken.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.090
What is this thing?

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.950
Don't touch it!

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.440
Lend me that game 
we played the other day!
 -Suguru

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:42.440
Suguru...

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.700
Suguru?

00:14:44.850 --> 00:14:45.900
My friend.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.430
Seems he doesn't think I'm 
his friend anymore, though.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.760
Don't mess with this again, all right?

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:55.200
Stupid...

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.810
Losing a friend is no big deal.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.380
Kanate...

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:05.050
But more importantly, 
we've got trouble, Arata!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.180
That Ohika guy is 
Lord Kannagi's Zokusho.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.220
Huh? Zokusho?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:16.140
The Sho who serve the Twelve Shinsho!

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.550
If he finds out you're a Sho...

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:23.160
I hear you've awakened.

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.700
<i>A Hayagami...</i>

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.280
So you're a Sho, too.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:34.290
Honi told me.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:38.270
It's quite damaged.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:48.390
That should do it.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:53.730
This Hayagami's Kamui 
is Kaneri, the forge.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:56.560
It makes farm tools 
and, sometimes, armor.

00:15:57.060 --> 00:15:58.500
You make armor with Kamui?

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.080
Kamui are not only for fighting.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:05.140
Thanks to Kaneri, 
Lord Kannagi is good to us.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.630
He has always been well respected.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:11.520
When I informed him that 
my wife was expecting,

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.610
he was incredibly happy for me.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.440
I guess that's about it.

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.400
These eggs looks delicious.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:23.440
Our eggs are the best around.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:27.510
Of course, muru eggs are better-tasting 
and more nutritious.

00:16:28.570 --> 00:16:31.340
Too bad about that muru egg.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.970
I wanted to give some 
to Master Arata, too.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:41.560
D-Do guys like frilly things like that?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.690
Huh? Oh, my clothes?

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.570
Would you like to try it on? You can.

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:50.930
N-No! It's just, the mistress 
wears that stuff, too,

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:54.030
so I thought the master 
must like that style.

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:56.990
You love Ohika-san.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:17:01.020
F-Fool! I never said that!

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.580
My wound aches, Emisu.

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.190
Appear!

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:33.400
I will not allow your freedom 
to be restrained any further.

00:17:34.170 --> 00:17:37.110
I will take the throne, for you.

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:39.160
Lord Kannagi!

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:40.950
What is it?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.660
There's trouble! Hurry to 
Master Kigisu's house!

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:46.590
Kigisu!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.030
What is this?

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.200
Lord Kannagi...

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:56.130
What happened?! Where's Kigisu?!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.090
Lord Akachi, he...

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:05.850
Ah, Master Ohika!

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:08.170
Fine weather today!

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.000
War, eh?

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:14.510
True, there's likely to be 
a battle for the throne.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:15.740
No...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:18.590
It may have already begun.

00:18:19.390 --> 00:18:21.330
You're not going to take part in it?

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.910
I'm content with the life I have now.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.870
I want to live with the 
people, love my family,

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.800
and end my life here quietly.

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:35.910
But I'm sure there are some 
Sho who don't feel that way.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:38.480
Killing each other just for rank...

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.930
One can claim the throne 
without killing,

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.810
if all the Sho submit to one man

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:48.190
and he unites the Hayagami.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.020
Submit...

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:57.510
Submission is when a Sho passes on his 
soul and Hayagami to another Sho.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.300
The soul submitted does not disappear,

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:04.140
but lives on within the 
Hayagami it submitted to.

00:19:05.770 --> 00:19:08.700
I hear that Tsutsuga of Gatoya

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:11.040
voluntarily submitted 
to another Sho recently.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:15.600
It's also said that this man 
wielded a new Hayagami

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:18.760
and attempted to take 
the life of the princess.

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:21.800
But if news from Gatoya is true,

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.770
the report of his 
treason was incorrect,

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.810
or it was a conspiracy.

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:30.240
Tsutsuga's Kamui, Saniwa, 
can see one's true nature.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:33.380
If he submitted to him voluntarily,

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.500
that Sho was no criminal.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.280
Come to think of it, 
strangely enough,

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:42.990
he had the same name as you.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:48.200
Master Ohika, you have a guest.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.210
A guest?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.630
Ohika-san will be so surprised!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.840
Th-This is too embarrassing.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.720
It's too big, especially 
in the chest.

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.920
It's fine!

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:02.350
Wait!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:09.600
I-I'm sorry! I'll change right away!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:10.630
Wait.

00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:12.320
I almost didn't recognize you.

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:16.360
It suits you. You look cute.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.980
I thought you were a child,

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:22.420
but I guess it's been six years

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.490
since Lord Kannagi found you 
and brought you here.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.260
You've grown into a fine girl.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:32.670
Anyway, Honi, I need you 
to do something urgent.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.050
Sasage! Kuroji!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:40.750
How brutal...

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.350
This is a massacre.

00:20:46.120 --> 00:20:47.310
Why?!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:49.400
There's only one left.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:52.980
Get the airship! 
We're going to Ohika's village!

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:55.150
Right away?

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.350
Yes, leave the village right away.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.800
I've prepared provisions for you.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.780
Hey, what's going on?

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.040
Did Ohika-san say to do this?

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.410
Thank you for coming all this way,

00:21:13.680 --> 00:21:14.780
Lord Akachi.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:18.290
It's been a long time, Ohika.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:22.670
It must be a very urgent matter 
if it brought you here

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:25.220
without any notice to Lord Kannagi.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:30.620
I've come to tell you, Kannagi's 
faithful Zokusho, the truth.

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.100
The truth?

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:37.400
The one behind the plot to murder 
the princess was Kannagi.

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:39.980
Wh-What are you...

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:42.970
In order to become the king himself,

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:45.260
he threw away his allegiance 
to the princess,

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:52.340
and he is now pursuing the boy he used 
in his uprising, to silence him.

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.790
Ohika, become my Zokusho.

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.950
You will accept, won't you?

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:09.260
<i>Ohika!</i>

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:44.020
Why, Akachi? Why did you do this?!

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:47.190
The battle for the throne 
has begun, Kannagi.

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:49.510
Now you will feel the pain of loss.

00:23:49.510 --> 00:23:51.860
The agony will remain with you forever.

00:23:50.970 --> 00:23:54.960
Okoro

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:54.960
Akachi!
